# 统一行尾：跨平台团队根治 CRLF/LF 引发的“每次更新都冲突”
# 文本文件一律以 LF 存储与检出；Windows 批处理按系统约定保留 CRLF
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh  text eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 二进制资源，禁止行尾归一化，避免文件损坏
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.p12 binary
*.zip binary
*.jar binary
*.war binary
*.gz binary
*.tar binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
